WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.067 --> 00:00:02.569
CLARE ABSHIRE:
<i> Are you in love?</i>

00:00:03.069 --> 00:00:04.237
I hope so.

00:00:05.171 --> 00:00:06.706
<i> But ask yourself this:</i>

00:00:06.939 --> 00:00:08.341
<i> When it happened,</i>

00:00:09.208 --> 00:00:11.244
<i> is any of it
 anything like you planned?</i>

00:00:12.412 --> 00:00:15.581
HENRY DETAMBLE:
<i> Is this person that now owns
 a huge part of your life</i>

00:00:15.614 --> 00:00:17.117
<i> anything like
 you thought they'd be?</i>

00:00:18.451 --> 00:00:20.186
Did they arrive when
they were supposed to?

00:00:21.687 --> 00:00:23.690
♪ (UPLIFTING MUSIC PLAYS) ♪

00:00:23.723 --> 00:00:25.958
HENRY:<i> Sometimes when
 I'm stressed, I time travel.</i>

00:00:26.559 --> 00:00:27.927
<i> I can't control it.</i>

00:00:31.397 --> 00:00:33.232
<i> If I make the mistake
 of loving someone,</i>

00:00:33.766 --> 00:00:35.869
<i> I don't know how many times
I'm going to have to lose them.</i>

00:00:35.902 --> 00:00:37.270
YOUNG HENRY:<i> Mom!</i>

00:00:40.272 --> 00:00:42.308
-Is that gonna happen now?
-Maybe.

00:00:43.543 --> 00:00:44.544
<i> I'm trying to hold on.</i>

00:00:45.712 --> 00:00:47.280
-(HORNS HONK)
-(TIRES SCREECH)

00:00:49.716 --> 00:00:50.883
Hey, hold on.

00:00:50.917 --> 00:00:53.820
-(HORNS HONK, TIRES SCREECH)
-Jesus Christ!

00:00:58.491 --> 00:00:59.958
So, how long
you been seeing Clare?

00:00:59.992 --> 00:01:01.161
HENRY:<i> From time to time.</i>

00:01:01.961 --> 00:01:02.962
I don't like him.

00:01:02.996 --> 00:01:04.463
SPEAKER:
But he's important to Clare.

00:01:04.497 --> 00:01:05.798
GOMEZ:
<i> How is that even possible?</i>

00:01:05.831 --> 00:01:06.833
Woo!

00:01:08.234 --> 00:01:10.136
INGRID: It'd be nice
if you at least appreciated him.

00:01:10.169 --> 00:01:12.271
I've loved him
since I was six years old.

00:01:12.304 --> 00:01:14.174
No, you loved him!

00:01:17.577 --> 00:01:19.912
It's me, Clare.
I'm Henry, the same Henry.

00:01:20.079 --> 00:01:21.181
Someday.

00:01:25.117 --> 00:01:26.519
Why is Clare crying?

00:01:26.585 --> 00:01:28.454
You can't change anything.
You couldn't even get married.

00:01:28.788 --> 00:01:33.993
♪ (MUSIC CLIMAXES) ♪

00:01:34.093 --> 00:01:35.528
CLARE:<i> I miss you.</i>

00:01:36.261 --> 00:01:37.363
HENRY:<i> I'm here now.</i>

